ension (#739)\n* 1eb3ed9a2973c6c9f4af5ffe9a0ab65684af3b3a feat : HTTP API expansion for parity with core DownloadService (#710)\n* 95c908ddd61fe257300fc22f56451b0586ca08f1 feat(cli): add bounded terminal progress and truthful transfer metrics (#762)\n* 7198cd6ce4adbd258a798a45a1f5491b04b2eecf feat(cli): add verified foreground downloads and artifact receipts (#761)\n* 20d4d685058f32a2c5159fe5839d16d0df4b84ba feat(cli): define versioned results and typed error contracts (#753)\n* 062235232e75308dd6299ea2e775128eeac09939 feat(cli): return per-input download submission receipts (#754)\n* 6a49211e6a4b50be572b18db43c499b09eba71b0 feat(nix): install official releases and automate updates (#752)\n* 9de4cfa1a0d85d5660b3c6a7d362633afcc573d7 fix(cli): make listing authoritative and watch output terminal-safe (#755)\n* c4898c3af56c82dbc5013845b2363c0a4c6d1da8 fix(events): isolate slow observers from lifecycle delivery (#756)\n* 249b6b3020259894ea06ce4d67df6bbd8113e25a fix(nix): refresh vendor hash and correct version flag (#750)\n* f805da47b7897ebd7aa1826cdba7e7e11d9c7275 fix(tui): label completion estimate as ETC (#732)\n* ca6a36d115438a47cfcb1fa24db63ec85155c110 fix(windows): scope service logon task to current user (#747)\n* b51d326c8e4cc73b1ddbee65d741d57245327bc0 fix: enforce single-owner invariant for same-ID downloads (#722)\n* b8f518a1eadafc506f9edfb950c6ecca484d13d4 fix: use non-deprecated postflight_steps in generated Homebrew cask (#748)\n* 81aa7b18aa96c22e5829379efc47ceb5d5265807 perf(cli): defer engine and local state initialization (#757)\n\n"}
